(3, 'Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Booking: Online Process, Price List & Contact Number Guide (2026)', 'shegaon-bhakta-niwas-room-booking-online-process-price-list-contact-number-guide-2026', 'Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room booking is one of the most searched queries by devotees planning a visit to Shri Gajanan Maharaj Temple, Shegaon.', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Every year, thousands of devotees visit Shegaon for darshan and require clean, affordable, and comfortable accommodation near the temple.<br>If you are planning your Shegaon trip and looking for information about&nbsp;<a href=\"../../\"><strong>Book Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room online</strong></a>, room availability, booking process, price list, and contact details, this complete guide will help you plan your stay easily.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas provides accommodation facilities for devotees with different room categories including attached rooms, common rooms, double-bed rooms, and deluxe rooms based on availability.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">About Shegaon Bhakta Niwas</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon is a famous spiritual destination located in Buldhana district, Maharashtra, known for the sacred <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shri Gajanan Maharaj Temple</strong>.</a> Devotees from Maharashtra and different parts of India visit this holy place throughout the year.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">To provide convenient accommodation, Shri Gajanan Maharaj Sansthan manages multiple Bhakta Niwas facilities near the temple area. These accommodations are designed to offer devotees a peaceful and affordable stay during their pilgrimage.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Booking Online Process</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Many devotees search for <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room online booking</strong></a> before visiting Shegaon. Booking your room in advance can help you avoid last-minute accommodation problems, especially during festivals and peak seasons.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Follow these simple steps:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Step 1: Check Room Availability</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Before booking, check the availability of rooms according to your travel date. Room availability depends on the number of visitors and current occupancy.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Step 2: Select Your Room Type</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Depending on availability, devotees can choose suitable accommodation options such as:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Double Bed Rooms</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Attached Rooms</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Common Rooms</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Deluxe Rooms</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dormitory Facilities</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Step 3: Provide Required Details</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">For booking, devotees may need to provide:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Name of visitor</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Mobile number</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Number of family members</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Date of arrival</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Valid ID proof details</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The Sansthan requires devotees to carry government or authentic ID proof while applying for accommodation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Step 4: Confirm Your Booking</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">After checking availability and completing the process, confirm your stay details and keep the booking confirmation safely.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Price List</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room price list</strong></a> depends on the type of room, facilities available, and accommodation category selected.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Approximate room categories include:</span></p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"mso-cellspacing: 1.5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184;\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Room Type</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Availability</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Common Rooms</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Budget-friendly stay option</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Double Bed Rooms</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Suitable for families</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Attached Rooms</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">More comfortable stay</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Deluxe Rooms</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Premium accommodation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Room charges may change depending on the season, facilities, and availability. Devotees should confirm the latest rates before booking.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Booking Contact Number</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">For room enquiry and booking information, devotees can contact the official Bhakta Niwas enquiry numbers.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shri Gajanan Maharaj Sansthan Contact Details:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Bhakta Niwas Mandir Parisar: <strong>07265-252018</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Bhakta Niwas Hattikhana Parisar: <strong>07265-252699</strong></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Visawa Bhakta Niwas: <strong>07265-253018 / 09657449495</strong></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">These numbers can be used for room availability and accommodation-related enquiries.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Best Time to Book Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Although Shegaon welcomes devotees throughout the year, advance booking is recommended during:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Gajanan Maharaj Prakat Din celebrations</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Guru Purnima</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Festivals</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Weekends</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Holiday seasons</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">During peak periods, accommodation demand increases significantly, so booking early is a better option.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Facilities Available at Shegaon Bhakta Niwas</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Devotees staying at Bhakta Niwas can expect basic and comfortable facilities such as:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Clean rooms</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Safe accommodation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Temple proximity</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Family-friendly environment</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Drinking water facilities</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Peaceful surroundings</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The Sansthan maintains systematic accommodation arrangements for a large number of devotees visiting Shegaon.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">How to Reach Shegaon</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon is well connected by railway and road networks. The city has a railway station on the Mumbai&ndash;Nagpur railway route, making it convenient for devotees travelling from different parts of India.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">By Train</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Railway Station is the easiest option for devotees travelling by train. Many major routes connect Shegaon with cities like Mumbai, Nagpur, Pune, and other locations.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">By Road</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Regular bus services are available from nearby cities including:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Akola</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Khamgaon</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Nagpur</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Buldhana</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Tips Before Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Booking</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">To enjoy a hassle-free stay, keep these points in mind:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Book your room before travelling during busy seasons.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Carry original government ID proof.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Confirm check-in timings.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Keep your booking details saved.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Contact Bhakta Niwas before arrival for availability confirmation.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1. How can I book Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room online?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">You can check accommodation availability and complete the booking process through available booking facilities or by contacting Bhakta Niwas enquiry numbers.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2. What is the contact number for Shegaon Bhakta Niwas booking?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">For room enquiries, devotees can contact Bhakta Niwas numbers provided by Shri Gajanan Maharaj Sansthan, including 07265-252018 and 07265-252699.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">3. What types of rooms are available at Shegaon Bhakta Niwas?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Different accommodation options are available including attached rooms, common rooms, double-bed rooms, and deluxe rooms depending on availability.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">4. Is advance booking required for Shegaon Bhakta Niwas?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Advance booking is recommended during festivals, weekends, and high-demand periods because rooms are provided based on availability.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">5. Is Bhakta Niwas near Gajanan Maharaj Temple?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Yes, Bhakta Niwas facilities are located near the temple premises and nearby areas for convenient access to darshan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Conclusion</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Finding a comfortable stay is an important part of your spiritual journey to Shegaon. With proper planning and timely <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room booking</strong></a>, devotees can enjoy a peaceful and convenient visit to Shri Gajanan Maharaj Temple.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Whether you are searching for <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room online booking</strong></a>, <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shegaon Bhakta Niwas booking contact number</strong></a>, or <a href=\"../../\"><strong>Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room price list</strong></a>, this guide provides complete information to help you plan your stay smoothly.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Plan your Shegaon visit in advance and experience a peaceful pilgrimage with comfortable accommodation near the temple.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'uploads/blogs/1787147614_Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Booking Online Process, Price List & Contact Number Guide (2026).jpg.jpeg', '[\"Booking\",\"Bhakta-Niwas\"]', '[\"Shegaon\",\"Shegon-Booking\",\"Bhakta-Niwas\"]', NULL, NULL, 'Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Booking: Online Process, Price List & Contact Number', 'Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room booking is one of the most searched queries by devotees planning a visit to Shri Gajanan Maharaj Temple, Shegaon. Every year, thousands of devotees visit Shegaon for darshan and require clean, affordable, and comfortable accommodation near the temple.', NULL, 1, 1, 1, '2026-08-19', 'active', '2026-08-19 20:53:34', '2026-08-19 20:53:34'),
(4, 'How to Book Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Online (Updated Price & Contact Details)', 'how-to-book-shegaon-bhakta-niwas-room-online-updated-price-contact-details', 'Looking for Shegaon Bhakta Niwas room booking? Check updated room rent, online booking details, contact information, facilities, and affordable accommodation near Gajanan Maharaj Temple Shegaon.', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">If you are planning a visit to <strong><a href=\"../../../\">Gajanan Maharaj Temple, Shegaon</a></strong>, finding a comfortable and affordable place to stay is very important. <strong><a href=\"../../../\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas</a></strong> is one of the most preferred accommodation options for devotees visiting the temple.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">It offers clean rooms, affordable pricing, essential facilities, and convenient access to the temple complex. Devotees can book rooms through available booking options and enjoy a peaceful stay during their pilgrimage.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Quick Overview - Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Booking Details </span></h2>\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 90.4661%; border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 489.515px;\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 35.6565%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Parameter</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 64.3456%; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Details</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 35.6565%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Location</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 64.3456%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Gajanan Maharaj Temple Complex, Shegaon</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 35.6565%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Starting Room Rent</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 64.3456%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">₹50 (Dormitory) to ₹1,500 (Deluxe AC Room)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 35.6565%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Booking Methods</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 64.3456%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Offline Spot Booking / Online Booking Portal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 35.6565%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">ID Proof Required</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding: 0.75pt; width: 64.3456%; text-align: center; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px