x; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); height: 54.3906px;\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Dormitory, Non-AC Rooms, AC Rooms</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">What is Shegaon Bhakta Niwas? </span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"../../../\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas</span></strong></a><span lang=\"EN-IN\"> is a dedicated accommodation facility developed for devotees visiting the famous <a href=\"../../../\"><strong>Gajanan Maharaj Temple in Shegaon, Maharashtra</strong>.</a></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Thousands of devotees visit Shegaon every year, and Bhakta Niwas provides budget-friendly accommodation options for short stays. The facility is designed to provide comfortable lodging with basic amenities at reasonable prices.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Whether you are travelling alone, with family, or in a group, Shegaon Bhakta Niwas offers different room categories according to your requirements and budget.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Room Booking Options </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Devotees can book accommodation through the following methods:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1. Online Room Booking</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Online booking is a convenient option for visitors who want to plan their stay before reaching Shegaon.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Steps generally include:</span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Visit the official booking portal. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Select your preferred check-in and check-out dates. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Choose available room type. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Provide personal details. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Complete the booking process. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Carry booking confirmation during check-in. </span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Online booking helps visitors avoid inconvenience during busy seasons and festivals.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2. Offline Spot Booking </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Visitors can also book rooms directly after reaching Shegaon.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">For offline booking:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Visit the Bhakta Niwas booking counter. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Check room availability. </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Submit required ID proof. </span></li>\r\n<li class=