><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Clean Accommodation </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Rooms are maintained with basic cleanliness standards to provide a comfortable experience for devotees.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Hot Water Facility </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Hot water availability helps visitors, especially families and senior citizens.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Railway Station Connectivity </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Devotees can benefit from convenient transportation facilities between Shegaon Railway Station and temple premises.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Parking Facility </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Parking arrangements are available for visitors travelling by private vehicles.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Temple Accessibility </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">The accommodation location provides easy access to <a href=\"../../../\"><strong>Shri Gajanan Maharaj Temple</strong></a>.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Documents Required for Shegaon Bhakta Niwas Booking </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Visitors need valid identity proof during booking and check-in.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Accepted documents may include:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Aadhaar Card </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\